opic. Let me pick a general topic that's often presented, like \\\"Introduction to Artificial Intelligence\\\" in Vietnamese. That makes sense because the example used AI as well. \\n\\nNow, the outline needs to have 10 total slides. Let me divide that into sections. The example had 6 sections with varying numbers of slides. Let me see: 2 slides for introduction, 3 for history, 2 for applications, 2 for challenges, 1 for future, and 0 for conclusion. Wait, the conclusion has 0 slides? That might be a mistake. Maybe the example had a typo. I'll make sure each section has at least one slide.\\n\\nLet me start by listing the main sections. Introduction, History, Applications, Challenges, Future, and Conclusion. That's 6 sections. The example had 6 sections with 10 slides total. Let me allocate the slides accordingly. Maybe 2 for intro, 3 for history, 2 for applications, 2 for challenges, 1 for future, and 0 for conclusion. Wait, but the conclusion should have a slide. Maybe adjust the numbers. Let's say 2 slides for intro, 3 for history, 2 for applications, 2 for challenges, 1 for future, and 0 for conclusion. Hmm, that adds up to 10. Maybe the conclusion is part of the last section. Alternatively, maybe the example's conclusion was a separate section with 1 slide. Let me check the example again.\\n\\nIn the example, the last section is \\\"Kết luận và triển vọng tương lai\\\" with 1 slide. So the total slides would be 2+3+2+2+1=10. Oh, right, that's 10. So maybe the user wants the outline to have sections that sum up to 10 slides. Let me follow that structure. \\n\\nSo for each section, I need to assign a number of slides and key points. Let's outline:\\n\\n1. Giới thiệu về AI (2 slides): Define AI, its importance, and basic concepts.\\n2. Lịch sử phát triển của AI (3 slides): Early beginnings, key milestones, recent advancements.\\n3. Ứng dụng của AI (2 slides): Current applications in various industries.\\n4. Thách thức và hạn chế của AI (2 slides): Ethical issues, technical challenges.\\n5. Triển vọng tương lai của AI (1 slide): Future trends and predictions.\\n6. Kết luận (0 slides? No, maybe 1 slide): Summary and Q&A.\\n\\nWait, but the example had 6 sections with total 10 slides. Let me check the example again. The example's total slides were 10, and the sections added up to 10. The example's sections were:\\n\\n- Giới thiệu về AI (2 slides)\\n- Lịch sử phát triển của AI (3 slides)\\n- Ứng dụng của AI (2 slides)\\n- Thách thức và hạn chế của AI (2 slides)\\n- Triển vọng tương lai của AI (1 slide)\\n- Kết luận (0 slides)\\n\\nWait, that adds up to 2+3+2+2+1=10. The conclusion section is 0 slides? Maybe the conclusion is part of the last section. So in the example, the last section includes both future and conclusion. Maybe the user expects the same here. So I can adjust the sections to fit 10 slides. \\n\\nI need to make sure that the key points are relevant to each section. For example, in the introduction, define AI, its importance, and basic concepts. In the history section, talk about the origins, key developments, and recent breakthroughs. Applications could cover different industries. Challenges might include ethical issues and technical problems. Future trends and a conclusion. \\n\\nAlso, the chunk_mapping is empty in the example. Maybe that's just a placeholder. The theme suggestion was \\\"midnight,\\\" so I'll keep that. The language is Vietnamese, so all titles and key points must be in Vietnamese. \\n\\nLet me put this all together into the JSON structure as specified. Make sure the section IDs start at 0 and increment correctly. Check the total slides add up to 10. Ensure the topic is filled in as \\\"Giới thiệu về trí tuệ nhân tạo (AI)\\\" and the context is general. \\n\\nI think that's a solid approach. Now, let me draft the JSON accordingly.\\n</think>\\n\\n```json\\n{\\n  \\\"outline\\\": [\\n    {\\n      \\\"section_id\\\": 0,\\n      \\\"title\\\": \\\"Giới thiệu về Trí tuệ Nhân tạo (AI)\\\",\\n      \\\"slides\\\": 2,\\n      \\\"key_points\\\": [\\n        \\\"Định nghĩa Trí tuệ Nhân tạo\\\",\\n        \\\"Vai trò và tầm quan trọng của AI trong đời sống hiện đại\\\",\\n        \\\"Các lĩnh vực ứng dụng cơ bản của AI\\\"\\n      ]\\n    },\\n    {\\n      \\\"section_id\\\": 1,\\n      \\\"title\\\": \\\"Lịch sử phát triển của AI\\\",\\n      \\\"slides\\\": 3,\\n      \\\"key_points\\\": [\\n        \\\"Các mốc thời gian quan trọng trong lịch sử AI\\\",\\n        \\\"Sự tiến bộ của AI từ giai đoạn sơ khai đến hiện đại\\\",\\n        \\\"Những cột mốc công nghệ đánh dấu sự bùng nổ AI\\\"\\n      ]\\n    },\\n    {\\n      \\\"section_id\\\": 2,\\n      \\\"title\\\": \\\"Ứng dụng thực tiễn của AI\\\",\\n      \\\"slides\\\": 2,\\n      \\\"key_points\\\": [\\n        \\\"AI trong y tế, tài chính, giáo dục và giao thông\\\",\\n        \\\"Ví dụ cụ thể về các sản phẩm AI đang được sử dụng rộng rãi\\\"\\n      ]\\n    },\\n    {\\n      \\\"section_id\\\": 3,\\n      \\\"title\\\": \\\"Thách thức và hạn chế của AI\\\",\\n      \\\"slides\\\": 2,\\n      \\\"key_points\\\": [\\n        \\\"Vấn đề đạo đức và quyền riêng tư khi sử dụng AI\\\",\\n        \\\"Hạn chế về khả năng tư duy sáng tạo và xử lý tình huống phức tạp của AI\\\",\\n        \\\"Tác động của AI đến việc làm và xã hội\\\"\\n      ]\\n    },\\n    {\\n      \\\"section_id\\\": 4,\\n      \\\"title\\\": \\\"Triển vọng tương lai của AI\\\",\\n      \\\"slides\\\": 1,\\n      \\\"key_points\\\": [\\n        \\\"Xu hướng phát triển AI trong thập kỷ tới\\\",\\n        \\\"Khả năng tích hợp AI vào các lĩnh vực chưa được khai thác\\\"\\n      ]\\n    }\\n  ],\\n  \\\"chunk_mapping\\\": {},\\n  \\\"total_slides\\\": 10,\\n  \\\"topic\\\": \\\"Giới thiệu về Trí tuệ Nhân tạo (AI)\\\",\\n  \\\"language\\\": \\\"vi\\\",\\n  \\\"context\\\": \\\"general\\\",\\n  \\\"theme_suggestion\\\": \\\"midnight\\\"\\n}\\n```\",\"generationInfo\":{\"finish_reason\":\"stop\"}}]]},\"tokenUsage\":{\"completionTokens\":1588,\"prom