ly, maybe the user provided a prompt in another part of the conversation that's missing here. Since I can't see previous messages, I'll have to make an educated guess.\\n\\nWait, the user's instruction says \\\"Từ prompt sau, hãy tạo outline cho presentation.\\\" which translates to \\\"From the following prompt, create an outline for the presentation.\\\" But the prompt is undefined. That's confusing. Perhaps the user intended to include a prompt but it got cut off. In that case, maybe I should use the example's structure and topic as a model but come up with a new topic. Let me go with a general technology topic in Vietnamese. For example, \\\"Công nghệ Blockchain và Ứng Dụng Trong Đời Sống Hiện Đại.\\\" Then, create an outline with 10 slides, split into sections. The example had 4 sections with varying slides and key points. I need to make sure the total slides add up to 10. Let me break it down:\\n\\nSection 1: Giới thiệu tổng quan (2 slides)\\n- What is blockchain?\\n- Key features and benefits\\n\\nSection 2: Lịch sử phát triển (2 slides)\\n- Origin and evolution\\n- Major milestones\\n\\nSection 3: Ứng dụng thực tế (3 slides)\\n- Finance (cryptocurrencies)\\n- Supply chain management\\n- Healthcare and other sectors\\n\\nSection 4: Thách thức và tương lai (3 slides)\\n- Current challenges (scalability, regulation)\\n- Future trends and potential\\n- Conclusion and Q&A\\n\\nThat adds up to 10 slides. The chunk mapping would be empty since there's no content provided. Theme suggestion is midnight as in the example. Language is Vietnamese. Context is general. I need to structure this into JSON as per the schema. Make sure each section has a title in Vietnamese, correct number of slides, and key points. Also, check for any typos or inconsistencies. Alright, let's put it all together.\\n</think>\\n\\n```json\\n{\\n  \\\"outline\\\": [\\n    {\\n      \\\"section_id\\\": 0,\\n      \\\"title\\\": \\\"Giới thiệu tổng quan về chủ đề trình bày\\\",\\n      \\\"slides\\\": 2,\\n      \\\"key_points\\\": [\\\"Mục tiêu của bài trình bày\\\", \\\"Các khái niệm cơ bản liên quan\\\"]\\n    },\\n    {\\n      \\\"section_id\\\": 1,\\n      \\\"title\\\": \\\"Phân tích chi tiết các yếu tố chính\\\",\\n      \\\"slides\\\": 3,\\n      \\\"key_points\\\": [\\\"Yếu tố 1 và vai trò\\\", \\\"Yếu tố 2 và mối liên hệ\\\", \\\"Yếu tố 3 và tác động\\\"]\\n    },\\n    {\\n      \\\"section_id\\\": 2,\\n      \\\"title\\\": \\\"Ví dụ minh họa và trường hợp cụ thể\\\",\\n      \\\"slides\\\": 2,\\n      \\\"key_points\\\": [\\\"Trường hợp thành công\\\", \\\"Bài học rút ra\\\"]\\n    },\\n    {\\n      \\\"section_id\\\": 3,\\n      \\\"title\\\": \\\"Thách thức và giải pháp triển khai\\\",\\n      \\\"slides\\\": 2,\\n      \\\"key_points\\\": [\\\"Rào cản hiện tại\\\", \\\"Chiến lược vượt qua\\\"]\\n    },\\n    {\\n      \\\"section_id\\\": 4,\\n      \\\"title\\\": \\\"Kết luận và định hướng tương lai\\\",\\n      \\\"slides\\\": 1,\\n      \\\"key_points\\\": [\\\"Tổng kết nội dung\\\", \\\"Gợi ý nghiên cứu sâu hơn\\\"]\\n    }\\n  ],\\n  \\\"chunk_mapping\\\": {},\\n  \\\"total_slides\\\": 10,\\n  \\\"topic\\\": \\\"Chủ đề tổng quát chưa xác định\\\",\\n  \\\"language\\\": \\\"vi\\\",\\n  \\\"context\\\": \\\"general\\\",\\n  \\\"theme_suggestion\\\": \\\"midnight\\\"\\n}\\n```\",\"generationInfo\":{\"finish_reason\":\"stop\"}}]]},\"tokenUsage\":{\"completionTokens\":944,\"promptTokens\":106,\"totalTokens\":1050}}}"}}
