{"__type":"$$EventMessageAiNode","id":"4a3e882f-2875-4cfc-ac87-4d9443bfe22c","ts":"2026-06-09T03:16:55.574-04:00","eventName":"n8n.ai.llm.generated","message":"n8n.ai.llm.generated","payload":{"executionId":"19","nodeName":"Model for LLM: Direct Outline","workflowName":"PPTX-Slides: Analysis Pipeline","nodeType":"@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.lmChatOpenAi","workflowId":"P7OnkXnYqu22vHlL","msg":"{\"messages\":[\"Human: Từ prompt sau, hãy tạo outline cho presentation.\\n\\nTrả về JSON:\\n{\\n  \\\"outline\\\": [{\\\"section_id\\\": 0, \\\"title\\\": \\\"...\\\", \\\"slides\\\": 2, \\\"key_points\\\": [\\\"...\\\"]}],\\n  \\\"chunk_mapping\\\": {},\\n  \\\"total_slides\\\": 10,\\n  \\\"topic\\\": \\\"...\\\",\\n  \\\"language\\\": \\\"vi\\\",\\n  \\\"context\\\": \\\"general\\\",\\n  \\\"theme_suggestion\\\": \\\"midnight\\\"\\n}\\n\\nUser prompt: undefined\"],\"options\":{\"openai_api_key\":{\"lc\":1,\"type\":\"secret\",\"id\":[\"OPENAI_API_KEY\"]},\"model\":\"Qwen3-32B\",\"timeout\":60000,\"max_retries\":2,\"configuration\":{\"baseURL\":\"https://mkp-api.fptcloud.com/v1\",\"fetchOptions\":{}},\"model_kwargs\":{}},\"response\":{\"response\":{\"generations\":[[{\"text\":\"<think>\\nOkay, the user wants me to create an outline for a presentation based on a prompt, but the actual prompt is undefined. Hmm, that's tricky. I need to figure out what topic they're referring to. Since the prompt is undefined, maybe they provided it in a previous message or there's a context I'm missing. But according to the current information, the topic isn't specified.\\n\\nWait, the example they gave has a \\\"topic\\\" field with \\\"...\\\", so maybe I should generate a generic outline. Let me check the user's instruction again. They want the outline in JSON format with sections, each having a title, number of slides, and key points. The total slides should be 10, and the language is Vietnamese. The context is general, and the theme suggestion is midnight.\\n\\nSince the topic is undefined, perhaps I should create a placeholder outline. Maybe start with an introduction, then move through main points, and conclude. Let me think of a common topic structure. For example, a business presentation might have sections like Introduction, Market Analysis, Product Overview, Marketing Strategy, Financial Plan, Risk Management, Conclusion.\\n\\nBut since the topic is unspecified, I need to make it as general as possible. Let me structure it with typical sections that can apply to various topics. Let's see: Introduction, Key Objectives, Current Situation, Challenges, Solutions, Implementation Plan, Benefits, Future Outlook, Conclusion. That could work. Each section would have a couple of slides. Let me count the slides to ensure it totals 10. \\n\\nSection 0: Introduction - 2 slides. Key points: Welcome, Purpose, Agenda.\\nSection 1: Key Objectives - 2 slides. Points: Main Goals, Strategic Importance.\\nSection 2: Current Situation - 2 slides. Points: Present Status, Data/Analysis.\\nSection 3: Challenges - 1 slide. Points: Major Obstacles.\\nSection 4: Solutions - 2 slides. Points: Proposed Strategies, Action Steps.\\nSection 5: Implementation Plan - 1 slide. Points: Timeline, Resources.\\nSection 6: Benefits - 1 slide. Points: Expected Outcomes, Value Added.\\nThat adds up to 9 slides. Wait, the total needs to be 10. Maybe add another section or adjust the slides per section. Let me add a Future Outlook section with 1 slide. Now total is 10. \\n\\nAlso, the chunk_mapping is empty in the example, so I'll leave it as an empty object. The theme is midnight, which is probably a dark theme for the slides. Make sure all titles are in Vietnamese. Let me translate each section title into Vietnamese. \\n\\nIntroduction becomes \\\"Giới thiệu\\\", Key Objectives is \\\"Mục tiêu chính\\\", Current Situation is \\\"Tình hình hiện tại\\\", Challenges is \\\"Thách thức\\\", Solutions is \\\"Giải pháp\\\", Implementation Plan is \\\"Kế hoạch triển khai\\\", Benefits is \\\"Lợi ích\\\", Future Outlook is \\\"Triển vọng tương lai\\\", Conclusion is \\\"Kết luận\\\". Wait, that's 8 sections. Oh right, the example uses section_id starting at 0, so maybe the sections are 0 to 8, totaling 9 sections. But the total slides should be 10. Let me check again.\\n\\nOriginal plan: 8 sections with 2,2,2,1,2,1,1,1 slides. That sums to 12. Wait, no. Let me recount:\\n\\nSection 0: 2 slides\\nSection 1: 2\\nSection 2: 2\\nSection 3: 1\\nSection 4: 2\\nSection 5: 1\\nSection 6: 1\\nSection 7: 1\\n\\nTotal: 2+2+2+1+2+1+1+1= 12. That's too many. Need to adjust. Maybe reduce some sections. Let's see. The example had 10 slides. Let me try:\\n\\nSection 0: Giới thiệu (2 slides)\\nSection 1: Mục tiêu chính (2)\\nSection 2: Tình hình hiện tại (2)\\nSection 3: Thách thức (1)\\nSection 4: Giải pháp (2)\\nSection 5: Triển vọng tương lai (1)\\nSection 6: Kết luận (1)\\nTotal: 2+2+2+1+2+1+1=11. Still over. Hmm. Maybe the original example had 10 slides. Let me adjust. Perhaps combine some sections. Let's see:\\n\\nMaybe reduce the slides in some sections. For example:\\n\\nSection 0: Giới thiệu (1 slide)\\nSection 1: Mục tiêu chính (1)\\nSection 2: Tình hình hiện tại (2)\\nSection 3: Thách thức (1)\\nSection 4: Giải pháp (2)\\nSection 5: Kế hoạch triển khai (1)\\nSection 6: Lợi ích (1)\\nSection 7: Triển vọng tương lai (1)\\nSection 8: Kết luận (1)\\nTotal: 1+1+2+1+2+1+1+1+1= 11. Still not 10. Maybe the example had a different structure. Let me check the example again. The example had a topic, but in this case, it's undefined. The user's example response has 10 slides. So I need to create an outline with exactly 10 slides. Let me try again:\\n\\nSection 0: Giới thiệu (2 slides)\\nSection 1: Mục tiêu chính (1)\\nSection 2: Tình hình hiện tại (2)\\nSection 3: Thách thức (1)\\nSection 4: Giải pháp (2)\\nSection 5: Kế hoạch triển khai (1)\\nSection 6: Lợi ích (1)\\nSection 7: Triển vọng tương lai (1)\\nTotal: 2+1+2+1+2+1+1+1= 11. Still over. Maybe the user's example had a different distribution. Let me look at the example provided by the user. In their example, the outline has 10 slides. Let me check how they structured it. The example's outline has 8 sections with varying slides adding up to 10. For example, maybe 2,2,2,1,2,1. Wait, the example's outline isn't visible here. Wait, the user provided a sample JSON structure but the actual example outline isn't shown. So I need to create an outline with 10 slides. Let me adjust:\\n\\nSection 0: Giới thiệu (2 slides)\\nSection 1: Mục tiêu chính (1)\\nSection 2: Tình hình hiện tại (2)\\nSection 3: Thách thức (1)\\nSection 4: Giải pháp (2)\\nSection 5: Triển vọng tương lai (1)\\nSection 6: Kết luận (1)\\nTotal: 2+1+2+1+2+1+1= 10. Yes, that works. Now, I need to make sure each section's key points are in Vietnamese and relevant. For example, in \\\"Giới thiệu\\\", key points could be \\\"Chào mừng\\\", \\\"Mục đích của bài trình bày\\\", \\\"Các nội dung chính\\\". Then \\\"Mục tiêu chính\\\" could have \\\"Xác định mục tiêu cụ thể\\\", \\\"Tầm quan trọng của từng mục tiêu\\\". \\n\\nI need to ensure that the key points are concise and fit within the slide count. Each slide in a section might have one key point or two. Let me structure each section accordingly. Also, the chunk_mapping is supposed to map sections to content chunks, but since the user's example has an empty object, maybe I should leave it as is. \\n\\nAlright, putting it all together now. The topic is left as \\\"...\\\" since it's undefined. The language is Vietnamese, and the theme is midnight. The outline will have 7 sections totaling 10 slides. Let me verify once more. Yes, 2+1+2+1+2+1+1=10. That should work.\\n</think>\\n\\n```json\\n{\\n  \\\"outline\\\": [\\n    {\\n      \\\"section_id\\\": 0,\\n      \\\"title\\\": \\\"Giới thiệu\\\",\\n      \\\"slides\\\": 2,\\n      \\\"key_points\\\": [\\\"Chào mừng\\\", \\\"Mục đích của bài trình bày\\\", \\\"Các nội dung chính\\\"]\\n    },\\n    {\\n      \\\"section_id\\\": 1,\\n      \\\"title\\\": \\\"Mục tiêu chính\\\",\\n      \\\"slides\\\": 1,\\n      \\\"key_points\\\": [\\\"Xác định mục tiêu cụ thể\\\", \\\"Tầm quan trọng của từng mục tiêu\\\"]\\n    },\\n    {\\n      \\\"section_id\\\": 2,\\n      \\\"title\\\": \\\"Tình hình hiện tại\\\",\\n      \\\"slides\\\": 2,\\n      \\\"key_points\\\": [\\\"Dữ liệu và phân tích thị trường\\\", \\\"Đánh giá nguồn lực hiện có\\\"]\\n    },\\n    {\\n      \\\"section_id\\\": 3,\\n      \\\"title\\\": \\\"Thách thức\\\",\\n      \\\"slides\\\": 1,\\n      \\\"key_points\\\": [\\\"Các rào cản chính\\\", \\\"Rủi ro tiềm tàng\\\"]\\n    },\\n    {\\n      \\\"section_id\\\": 4,\\n      \\\"title\\\": \\\"Giải pháp\\\",\\n      \\\"slides\\\": 2,\\n      \\\"key_points\\\": [\\\"Chiến lược đề xuất\\\", \\\"Các bước thực hiện cụ thể\\\"]\\n    },\\n    {\\n      \\\"section_id\\\": 5,\\n      \\\"title\\\": \\\"Triển vọng tương lai\\\",\\n      \\\"slides\\\": 1,\\n      \\\"key_points\\\": [\\\"Dự báo kết quả\\\", \\\"Cơ hội phát triển\\\"]\\n    },\\n    {\\n      \\\"section_id\\\": 6,\\n      \\\"title\\\": \\\"Kết luận\\\",\\n      \\\"slides\\\": 1,\\n      \\\"key_points\\\": [\\\"Tóm tắt nội dung\\\", \\\"Thông điệp chính\\\"]\\n    }\\n  ],\\n  \\\"chunk_mapping\\\": {},\\n  \\\"total_slides\\\": 10,\\n  \\\"topic\\\": \\\"...\\\",\\n  \\\"language\\\": \\\"vi\\\",\\n  \\\"context\\\": \\\"general\\\",\\n  \\\"theme_suggestion\\\": \\\"midnight\\\"\\n}\\n```\",\"generationInfo\":{\"finish_reason\":\"stop\"}}]]},\"tokenUsage\":{\"completionTokens\":2128,\"promptTokens\":106,\"totalTokens\":2234}}}"}}
