 or strategies. After that, a case study or examples to illustrate the points, then future outlook or next steps, and finally a conclusion with a Q&A slide.\\n\\nWait, but since the topic is undefined, the key points should be general enough. For example, in the introduction, I can talk about the importance of presentations and setting objectives. The overview section can cover main areas or themes. Challenges might include common issues like audience engagement or time management. Solutions could be tips or best practices. Case studies would be hypothetical examples, and future outlook can discuss trends or advancements.\\n\\nI also need to make sure each section has the right number of slides. Let me count again: intro (2), overview (2), challenges (2), solutions (2), case study (1), future (1), conclusion (1). Wait, that adds up to 9. Oh, the user wants 10 slides. So maybe add an extra slide to one of the sections. Maybe the solutions part can have 3 slides instead of 2. Or perhaps split the case study into two slides. Let me adjust that.\\n\\nAlso, the chunk mapping is supposed to map each slide to a section. Since the prompt is undefined, maybe the chunks are just placeholders. But the user didn't provide any content, so the chunk mapping might be empty. The theme suggestion is midnight, which is probably a dark theme, so that's noted.\\n\\nI need to ensure the titles are in Vietnamese as per the language parameter. Let me translate each section title accordingly. For example, \\\"Giới thiệu\\\" for Introduction, \\\"Tổng quan chủ đề\\\" for Topic Overview, etc.\\n\\nLet me structure the outline now. Each section will have a section_id, title, number of slides, and key points. The key points should be relevant to the section and in Vietnamese. For example, in the introduction, key points could be about the purpose of the presentation and objectives. In the overview, main themes or areas covered. Challenges might list common problems, solutions could be strategies to overcome them. Case study would have examples, future outlook could discuss trends, and conclusion would summarize and call to action.\\n\\nI need to make sure the JSON is correctly formatted with the right number of slides adding up to 10. Let me check the slide counts again. Intro 2, Overview 2, Challenges 2, Solutions 2, Case Study 1, Future 1, Conclusion 1. That's 9. Maybe add an extra slide to the solutions section, making it 3 slides. Then total becomes 10. Alternatively, split the case study into two slides. But the user might prefer fewer sections with more slides. Let's go with solutions having 3 slides. That makes sense because solutions can be detailed. Let me adjust the outline accordingly.\\n\\nAlso, the key points for each section need to be concise. For example, in the challenges section, key points could be identifying problems, analyzing root causes, and possible obstacles. In solutions, strategies, implementation steps, and evaluation methods.\\n\\nAlright, putting it all together. The outline should have 7 sections with the correct number of slides each. The chunk mapping is empty because there's no specific content provided. The topic remains as \\\"...\\\" since it's undefined. The theme is midnight, and the language is Vietnamese. Let me verify the JSON structure once more to ensure it's valid and meets the user's requirements.\\n</think>\\n\\n{\\n  \\\"outline\\\": [\\n    {\\\"section_id\\\": 0, \\\"title\\\": \\\"Giới thiệu\\\", \\\"slides\\\": 2, \\\"key_points\\\": [\\\"Mục đích của bài thuyết trình\\\", \\\"Đối tượng thính giả\\\", \\\"Các mục tiêu chính\\\"]},\\n    {\\\"section_id\\\": 1, \\\"title\\\": \\\"Tổng quan chủ đề\\\", \\\"slides\\\": 2, \\\"key_points\\\": [\\\"Khái niệm cơ bản\\\", \\\"Lý do chủ đề này quan trọng\\\", \\\"Phạm vi nội dung\\\"]},\\n    {\\\"section_id\\\": 2, \\\"title\\\": \\\"Thách thức và cơ hội\\\", \\\"slides\\\": 2, \\\"key_points\\\": [\\\"Những vấn đề thường gặp\\\", \\\"Cơ hội cải thiện\\\", \\\"Phân tích xu hướng hiện tại\\\"]},\\n    {\\\"section_id\\\": 3, \\\"title\\\": \\\"Giải pháp và chiến lược\\\", \\\"slides\\\": 3, \\\"key_points\\\": [\\\"Phương pháp tiếp cận hiệu quả\\\", \\\"Bước thực hiện cụ thể\\\", \\\"Ví dụ minh họa\\\"]},\\n    {\\\"section_id\\\": 4, \\\"title\\\": \\\"Kết luận và hành động tiếp theo\\\", \\\"slides\\\": 1, \\\"key_points\\\": [\\\"Tóm tắt nội dung chính\\\", \\\"Gợi ý hành động cho người nghe\\\", \\\"Câu hỏi mở\\\"]}\\n  ],\\n  \\\"chunk_mapping\\\": {},\\n  \\\"total_slides\\\": 10,\\n  \\\"topic\\\": \\\"Chủ đề tổng quát không xác định\\\",\\n  \\\"language\\\": \\\"vi\\\",\\n  \\\"context\\\": \\\"general\\\",\\n  \\\"theme_suggestion\\\": \\\"midnight\\\"\\n}\",\"generationInfo\":{\"finish_reason\":\"stop\"}}]]},\"tokenUsage\":{\"completionTokens\":1211,\"promptTokens\":106,\"totalTokens\":1317}}}"}}
