{"__type":"$$EventMessageAiNode","id":"b4eb4e5a-20e0-400f-8ffd-e1c490dae7a8","ts":"2026-06-09T04:52:17.424-04:00","eventName":"n8n.ai.llm.generated","message":"n8n.ai.llm.generated","payload":{"executionId":"29","nodeName":"Model for LLM: Direct Outline","workflowName":"PPTX-Slides: Analysis Pipeline","nodeType":"@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.lmChatOpenAi","workflowId":"P7OnkXnYqu22vHlL","msg":"{\"messages\":[\"Human: Từ prompt sau, hãy tạo outline cho presentation.\\n\\nTrả về JSON:\\n{\\n  \\\"outline\\\": [{\\\"section_id\\\": 0, \\\"title\\\": \\\"...\\\", \\\"slides\\\": 2, \\\"key_points\\\": [\\\"...\\\"]}],\\n  \\\"chunk_mapping\\\": {},\\n  \\\"total_slides\\\": 10,\\n  \\\"topic\\\": \\\"...\\\",\\n  \\\"language\\\": \\\"vi\\\",\\n  \\\"context\\\": \\\"general\\\",\\n  \\\"theme_suggestion\\\": \\\"midnight\\\"\\n}\\n\\nUser prompt: undefined\"],\"options\":{\"openai_api_key\":{\"lc\":1,\"type\":\"secret\",\"id\":[\"OPENAI_API_KEY\"]},\"model\":\"Qwen3-32B\",\"timeout\":60000,\"max_retries\":2,\"configuration\":{\"baseURL\":\"https://mkp-api.fptcloud.com/v1\",\"fetchOptions\":{}},\"model_kwargs\":{}},\"response\":{\"response\":{\"generations\":[[{\"text\":\"<think>\\nOkay, so the user wants me to create an outline for a presentation based on a prompt, but the prompt is undefined. Hmm, that's tricky. Let me think about how to approach this. First, I need to figure out what the user is really asking for. Maybe they provided a prompt earlier, and now they're following up with this request. Since the current prompt is undefined, perhaps there was a mistake or an oversight.\\n\\nI should check if there's any context from previous interactions that I can use. If not, maybe I need to make some assumptions. The example given in the problem has a structure with sections, slides, key points, etc. The user might be expecting a sample outline even without a specific prompt. Alternatively, maybe they intended to include a prompt but forgot. \\n\\nLooking at the required JSON format, the outline needs sections with IDs, titles, number of slides, and key points. The chunk mapping is empty, total slides are 10, and there's a theme suggestion of \\\"midnight\\\". The language is Vietnamese, and the context is general. \\n\\nSince the topic is undefined, I might need to create a generic outline. But wait, the example has a topic filled in as \\\"...\\\" so maybe the user expects me to generate a topic as well. Let me think of a common presentation topic that fits the midnight theme. Maybe something like \\\"The Impact of Nighttime Activities on Health\\\" or \\\"Exploring the Midnight Sky\\\". \\n\\nLet me go with \\\"The Impact of Nighttime Activities on Health\\\" as the topic. Now, structuring the outline into sections. Typically, a presentation has an introduction, main content sections, and a conclusion. For 10 slides, maybe 5 sections with 2 slides each. \\n\\nSection 1: Introduction (2 slides). Key points could be the importance of sleep and the significance of studying nighttime activities.\\n\\nSection 2: Types of Nighttime Activities (2 slides). Discuss common activities like late-night work, screen time, socializing, etc.\\n\\nSection 3: Effects on Physical Health (2 slides). Cover issues like sleep deprivation, metabolism, cardiovascular health.\\n\\nSection 4: Effects on Mental Health (2 slides). Stress, anxiety, cognitive function.\\n\\nSection 5: Recommendations and Conclusion (2 slides). Tips for healthy nighttime habits and summarizing key points.\\n\\nNow, translating these into Vietnamese. Make sure the key points are concise. Also, the chunk mapping is empty, so maybe it's not needed here. Let me put it all together in the required JSON format.\\n</think>\\n\\n```json\\n{\\n  \\\"outline\\\": [\\n    {\\n      \\\"section_id\\\": 0,\\n      \\\"title\\\": \\\"Giới thiệu chủ đề và mục tiêu trình bày\\\",\\n      \\\"slides\\\": 2,\\n      \\\"key_points\\\": [\\n        \\\"Giới thiệu tổng quan về chủ đề trình bày\\\",\\n        \\\"Đặt câu hỏi nghiên cứu hoặc mục tiêu chính\\\",\\n        \\\"Tầm quan trọng của chủ đề trong bối cảnh hiện tại\\\"\\n      ]\\n    },\\n    {\\n      \\\"section_id\\\": 1,\\n      \\\"title\\\": \\\"Cơ sở lý thuyết và bối cảnh\\\",\\n      \\\"slides\\\": 2,\\n      \\\"key_points\\\": [\\n        \\\"Giới thiệu các khái niệm nền tảng liên quan\\\",\\n        \\\"Phân tích bối cảnh xã hội/học thuật/kinh doanh\\\",\\n        \\\"Tham chiếu các nghiên cứu/tài liệu liên quan\\\"\\n      ]\\n    },\\n    {\\n      \\\"section_id\\\": 2,\\n      \\\"title\\\": \\\"Phân tích dữ liệu và bằng chứng\\\",\\n      \\\"slides\\\": 2,\\n      \\\"key_points\\\": [\\n        \\\"Trình bày dữ liệu định lượng/định tính chính\\\",\\n        \\\"Phân tích xu hướng và mối quan hệ\\\",\\n        \\\"Minh họa bằng biểu đồ, sơ đồ hoặc ví dụ cụ thể\\\"\\n      ]\\n    },\\n    {\\n      \\\"section_id\\\": 3,\\n      \\\"title\\\": \\\"Thách thức và cơ hội\\\",\\n      \\\"slides\\\": 2,\\n      \\\"key_points\\\": [\\n        \\\"Nhận diện rào cản hiện tại\\\",\\n        \\\"Đề xuất giải pháp hoặc cơ hội cải thiện\\\",\\n        \\\"So sánh các phương án triển khai\\\"\\n      ]\\n    },\\n    {\\n      \\\"section_id\\\": 4,\\n      \\\"title\\\": \\\"Kết luận và khuyến nghị\\\",\\n      \\\"slides\\\": 2,\\n      \\\"key_points\\\": [\\n        \\\"Tổng hợp kết quả chính\\\",\\n        \\\"Khuyến nghị hành động cụ thể\\\",\\n        \\\"Gợi mở hướng nghiên cứu/tiếp cận mới\\\"\\n      ]\\n    }\\n  ],\\n  \\\"chunk_mapping\\\": {},\\n  \\\"total_slides\\\": 10,\\n  \\\"topic\\\": \\\"Phân tích tác động của hoạt động đêm muộn đến sức khỏe\\\",\\n  \\\"language\\\": \\\"vi\\\",\\n  \\\"context\\\": \\\"general\\\",\\n  \\\"theme_suggestion\\\": \\\"midnight\\\"\\n}\\n```\",\"generationInfo\":{\"finish_reason\":\"stop\"}}]]},\"tokenUsage\":{\"completionTokens\":1012,\"promptTokens\":106,\"totalTokens\":1118}}}"}}
