{"__type":"$$EventMessageAiNode","id":"ae55976d-ad07-4768-8b5b-22c59411edab","ts":"2026-06-09T05:25:32.547-04:00","eventName":"n8n.ai.llm.generated","message":"n8n.ai.llm.generated","payload":{"executionId":"38","nodeName":"Model for LLM: Direct Outline","workflowName":"PPTX-Slides: Analysis Pipeline","nodeType":"@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.lmChatOpenAi","workflowId":"P7OnkXnYqu22vHlL","msg":"{\"messages\":[\"Human: Từ prompt sau, hãy tạo outline cho presentation.\\n\\nTrả về JSON:\\n{\\n  \\\"outline\\\": [{\\\"section_id\\\": 0, \\\"title\\\": \\\"...\\\", \\\"slides\\\": 2, \\\"key_points\\\": [\\\"...\\\"]}],\\n  \\\"chunk_mapping\\\": {},\\n  \\\"total_slides\\\": 10,\\n  \\\"topic\\\": \\\"...\\\",\\n  \\\"language\\\": \\\"vi\\\",\\n  \\\"context\\\": \\\"general\\\",\\n  \\\"theme_suggestion\\\": \\\"midnight\\\"\\n}\\n\\nUser prompt: undefined\"],\"options\":{\"openai_api_key\":{\"lc\":1,\"type\":\"secret\",\"id\":[\"OPENAI_API_KEY\"]},\"model\":\"Qwen3-32B\",\"timeout\":60000,\"max_retries\":2,\"configuration\":{\"baseURL\":\"https://mkp-api.fptcloud.com/v1\",\"fetchOptions\":{}},\"model_kwargs\":{}},\"response\":{\"response\":{\"generations\":[[{\"text\":\"<think>\\nOkay, let's tackle this. The user wants me to create an outline for a presentation based on their prompt, but the prompt is undefined. Hmm, that's a bit tricky. Since there's no specific information provided, I need to make some assumptions or maybe create a general outline that can be adapted later.\\n\\nFirst, I should check if there's any context in the example they provided. The example has a topic, sections with titles, key points, and some other parameters like language and theme. The original example's topic was about AI in Education, so maybe the user expects a similar structure but for an undefined topic. Wait, but the user's prompt is undefined. Maybe they forgot to include it? Or perhaps they want a template?\\n\\nSince the prompt is undefined, I might need to generate a generic outline. Let's think about common presentation structures. Usually, a presentation has an introduction, main sections, and a conclusion. The example had 10 slides, so I need to split the content into sections with appropriate slide counts.\\n\\nThe user specified the language as Vietnamese, so all titles and key points should be in Vietnamese. The theme suggestion is \\\"midnight,\\\" which is probably a dark theme, so maybe the outline should be visually engaging with high contrast.\\n\\nLet me start by setting a general topic. Since the context is \\\"general,\\\" maybe something broad like \\\"Introduction to Project Management.\\\" That's a common enough topic. Now, breaking it down into sections. Introduction (2 slides), Overview of Project Management (3 slides), Key Components (3 slides), Challenges and Solutions (2 slides), Conclusion (2 slides). Wait, but the total slides should be 10. Let me add up: 2+3+3+2=10? No, that's 10. Wait, the example had 10 slides. So maybe:\\n\\nSection 1: Giới thiệu chủ đề (2 slides)\\nSection 2: Tổng quan về quản lý dự án (3 slides)\\nSection 3: Các thành phần chính (3 slides)\\nSection 4: Thách thức và giải pháp (2 slides)\\nSection 5: Kết luận (2 slides)\\nWait, that totals 2+3+3+2+2=12 slides. Oh, but the user wants total_slides to be 10. Let me adjust. Maybe combine some sections or reduce the number of slides. For example:\\n\\nSection 1: Giới thiệu (2 slides)\\nSection 2: Tổng quan (2 slides)\\nSection 3: Các thành phần chính (3 slides)\\nSection 4: Thách thức và giải pháp (2 slides)\\nSection 5: Kết luận (1 slide)\\nBut that's 2+2+3+2+1=10. Alternatively, maybe have 4 sections. Let me see. The example had 4 sections with 2, 3, 3, 2 slides. Let's try that. So for a general topic, maybe:\\n\\n1. Giới thiệu (2 slides)\\n2. Tổng quan (3 slides)\\n3. Các thành phần chính (3 slides)\\n4. Kết luận và câu hỏi (2 slides)\\n\\nThat adds up to 10. Now, key points for each section. For the introduction, maybe define the topic, importance, objectives. For the overview, history, current trends. Key components could be methods, tools, best practices. Conclusion would summarize and open Q&A.\\n\\nI need to make sure the titles are in Vietnamese and the key points are concise. Also, the chunk_mapping is empty here since there's no specific content to map. The theme is midnight, so maybe dark colors and clean design. Alright, putting it all together in JSON format as specified.\\n</think>\\n\\n```json\\n{\\n  \\\"outline\\\": [\\n    {\\n      \\\"section_id\\\": 0,\\n      \\\"title\\\": \\\"Giới thiệu chủ đề\\\",\\n      \\\"slides\\\": 2,\\n      \\\"key_points\\\": [\\n        \\\"Giới thiệu tổng quan về chủ đề trình bày\\\",\\n        \\\"Tầm quan trọng của chủ đề trong bối cảnh hiện tại\\\",\\n        \\\"Mục tiêu và kết quả mong đợi từ bài trình bày\\\"\\n      ]\\n    },\\n    {\\n      \\\"section_id\\\": 1,\\n      \\\"title\\\": \\\"Tổng quan và bối cảnh\\\",\\n      \\\"slides\\\": 3,\\n      \\\"key_points\\\": [\\n        \\\"Các khái niệm cơ bản liên quan đến chủ đề\\\",\\n        \\\"Lịch sử phát triển hoặc xu hướng hiện tại\\\",\\n        \\\"Dữ liệu thống kê hoặc ví dụ thực tế minh họa\\\"\\n      ]\\n    },\\n    {\\n      \\\"section_id\\\": 2,\\n      \\\"title\\\": \\\"Chi tiết và phân tích\\\",\\n      \\\"slides\\\": 3,\\n      \\\"key_points\\\": [\\n        \\\"Các yếu tố chính ảnh hưởng đến chủ đề\\\",\\n        \\\"Phân tích sâu về các khía cạnh cụ thể\\\",\\n        \\\"So sánh với các tình huống liên quan hoặc đối thủ\\\"\\n      ]\\n    },\\n    {\\n      \\\"section_id\\\": 3,\\n      \\\"title\\\": \\\"Kết luận và hành động\\\",\\n      \\\"slides\\\": 2,\\n      \\\"key_points\\\": [\\n        \\\"Tóm tắt nội dung chính đã trình bày\\\",\\n        \\\"Gợi ý các bước thực hiện hoặc giải pháp đề xuất\\\",\\n        \\\"Mời đặt câu hỏi và thảo luận mở rộng\\\"\\n      ]\\n    }\\n  ],\\n  \\\"chunk_mapping\\\": {},\\n  \\\"total_slides\\\": 10,\\n  \\\"topic\\\": \\\"Chủ đề tổng quát chưa xác định\\\",\\n  \\\"language\\\": \\\"vi\\\",\\n  \\\"context\\\": \\\"general\\\",\\n  \\\"theme_suggestion\\\": \\\"midnight\\\"\\n}\\n```\",\"generationInfo\":{\"finish_reason\":\"stop\"}}]]},\"tokenUsage\":{\"completionTokens\":1173,\"promptTokens\":106,\"totalTokens\":1279}}}"}}
