{"__type":"$$EventMessageAiNode","id":"9a31205b-920c-4b6b-b1f9-447cac511e3b","ts":"2026-06-09T05:27:25.991-04:00","eventName":"n8n.ai.llm.generated","message":"n8n.ai.llm.generated","payload":{"executionId":"44","nodeName":"Model for LLM: Direct Outline","workflowName":"PPTX-Slides: Analysis Pipeline","nodeType":"@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.lmChatOpenAi","workflowId":"P7OnkXnYqu22vHlL","msg":"{\"messages\":[\"Human: Từ prompt sau, hãy tạo outline cho presentation.\\n\\nTrả về JSON:\\n{\\n  \\\"outline\\\": [{\\\"section_id\\\": 0, \\\"title\\\": \\\"...\\\", \\\"slides\\\": 2, \\\"key_points\\\": [\\\"...\\\"]}],\\n  \\\"chunk_mapping\\\": {},\\n  \\\"total_slides\\\": 10,\\n  \\\"topic\\\": \\\"...\\\",\\n  \\\"language\\\": \\\"vi\\\",\\n  \\\"context\\\": \\\"general\\\",\\n  \\\"theme_suggestion\\\": \\\"midnight\\\"\\n}\\n\\nUser prompt: undefined\"],\"options\":{\"openai_api_key\":{\"lc\":1,\"type\":\"secret\",\"id\":[\"OPENAI_API_KEY\"]},\"model\":\"Qwen3-32B\",\"timeout\":60000,\"max_retries\":2,\"configuration\":{\"baseURL\":\"https://mkp-api.fptcloud.com/v1\",\"fetchOptions\":{}},\"model_kwargs\":{}},\"response\":{\"response\":{\"generations\":[[{\"text\":\"<think>\\nOkay, let me tackle this. The user provided a prompt to create an outline for a presentation in Vietnamese, but the actual user prompt is undefined. Hmm, that's tricky. I need to figure out what the topic could be. Since there's no specific information, maybe I should go with a general topic that's commonly requested. Business presentations are always a safe bet. Let's say the topic is \\\"Giới thiệu về Marketing số\\\" (Introduction to Digital Marketing). \\n\\nNow, the outline needs 10 slides. Let me break it down into sections. Start with an introduction, then cover key concepts like SEO, social media, content marketing, email marketing, analytics, case studies, challenges, and a conclusion. Each section should have a couple of slides. For example, the introduction can have 2 slides, then each main topic gets 1-2 slides, and wrap up with challenges and conclusion.\\n\\nKey points for each section: Introduction should define digital marketing and its importance. SEO would include basics and on-page vs off-page strategies. Social media marketing needs platforms and content types. Content marketing could focus on creation and distribution. Email marketing involves building lists and automation. Analytics covers tools and metrics. Case studies provide real-world examples. Challenges might discuss common issues and solutions. Conclusion summarizes and looks to the future.\\n\\nChunk mapping isn't specified, so I'll leave it as an empty object. Theme suggestion is midnight, which fits a professional look. Make sure everything is in Vietnamese and the structure follows the JSON format. Let me check the slide counts add up to 10. Yep, 2+2+2+2+2+2+2+2+2+2? Wait, no, total slides should be 10. Let me adjust. Maybe the introduction has 2 slides, then each subsequent section has 1 or 2 slides. Let me recount: intro (2), SEO (2), social media (2), content (1), email (1), analytics (1), case study (1), challenges (1), conclusion (1). That totals 12. Oops, too many. Need to reduce. Maybe intro (2), SEO (1), social media (1), content (1), email (1), analytics (1), case study (1), challenges (1), conclusion (1). That's 9. Add one more to reach 10. Maybe split the introduction into 3 slides? Or add a section on trends. Let's try: intro (2), SEO (2), social media (2), content (1), email (1), analytics (1), case study (1), challenges (1), trends (1). Now total is 12 again. Hmm. Maybe some sections can have 1 slide each. Let's see: intro (2), SEO (1), social media (1), content (1), email (1), analytics (1), case study (1), challenges (1), conclusion (1). That's 9. Need one more. Maybe add a section on tools or future trends. Let's adjust. Intro (2), SEO (1), social media (1), content (1), email (1), analytics (1), case study (1), challenges (1), future (1), conclusion (1). Now it's 10. Okay, that works. Each section's key points should be concise. Make sure the JSON is correctly formatted with the right keys. Alright, I think that's a solid outline.\\n</think>\\n\\n```json\\n{\\n  \\\"outline\\\": [\\n    {\\n      \\\"section_id\\\": 0,\\n      \\\"title\\\": \\\"Giới thiệu chung về Marketing số\\\",\\n      \\\"slides\\\": 2,\\n      \\\"key_points\\\": [\\n        \\\"Định nghĩa và tầm quan trọng của Marketing số trong thời đại hiện nay\\\",\\n        \\\"Sự khác biệt giữa Marketing truyền thống và Marketing số\\\",\\n        \\\"Các kênh Marketing số phổ biến (SEO, Social Media, Email, v.v.)\\\"\\n      ]\\n    },\\n    {\\n      \\\"section_id\\\": 1,\\n      \\\"title\\\": \\\"Cơ bản về SEO (Tối ưu hóa công cụ tìm kiếm)\\\",\\n      \\\"slides\\\": 2,\\n      \\\"key_points\\\": [\\n        \\\"Giải thích cách hoạt động của các công cụ tìm kiếm\\\",\\n        \\\"Kỹ thuật SEO on-page và SEO off-page\\\",\\n        \\\"Công cụ hỗ trợ SEO và các chỉ số đo lường hiệu quả\\\"\\n      ]\\n    },\\n    {\\n      \\\"section_id\\\": 2,\\n      \\\"title\\\": \\\"Marketing qua mạng xã hội\\\",\\n      \\\"slides\\\": 2,\\n      \\\"key_points\\\": [\\n        \\\"Lựa chọn nền tảng phù hợp với đối tượng mục tiêu\\\",\\n        \\\"Chiến lược nội dung và tương tác trên mạng xã hội\\\",\\n        \\\"Phân tích hiệu quả của chiến dịch Social Media Marketing\\\"\\n      ]\\n    },\\n    {\\n      \\\"section_id\\\": 3,\\n      \\\"title\\\": \\\"Content Marketing (Marketing nội dung)\\\",\\n      \\\"slides\\\": 1,\\n      \\\"key_points\\\": [\\n        \\\"Vai trò của nội dung chất lượng trong thu hút khách hàng\\\",\\n        \\\"Quy trình xây dựng và phân phối nội dung hiệu quả\\\",\\n        \\\"Ví dụ minh họa về chiến dịch Content Marketing thành công\\\"\\n      ]\\n    },\\n    {\\n      \\\"section_id\\\": 4,\\n      \\\"title\\\": \\\"Email Marketing\\\",\\n      \\\"slides\\\": 1,\\n      \\\"key_points\\\": [\\n        \\\"Xây dựn