{"__type":"$$EventMessageAiNode","id":"0a1184c3-0442-46e3-86e1-93416470cbfb","ts":"2026-06-09T05:38:42.022-04:00","eventName":"n8n.ai.llm.generated","message":"n8n.ai.llm.generated","payload":{"executionId":"55","nodeName":"Model for LLM: Select Layouts","workflowName":"PPTX-Slides: Design Pipeline","nodeType":"@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.lmChatOpenAi","workflowId":"8LVqIvaDIEpH51yk","msg":"{\"messages\":[\"Human: Cho mỗi slide dưới đây, chọn layout phù hợp nhất.\\n\\nDanh sách layouts: cover, section-header, bullets, two-column, comparison, pros-cons, timeline, roadmap, stat-highlight, kpi-grid, quote, image-full, image-left, image-right, code, terminal, table, chart-placeholder, mindmap, pyramid, funnel, process-steps, checklist, team-grid, pricing, faq, demo, video-embed, closing, thank-you, contact\\n\\nSlides:\\nSlide 1: \\\"Chủ đề Midnight là gì?\\\" — - Midnight theme là phong cách thiết kế lấy cảm hứng từ bầu trời đêm với gam màu tối chủ đạo.\\n- Đặc ...\\nSlide 2: \\\"Nguyên tắc thiết kế cốt lõi\\\" — - Màu sắc tập trung vào các tông màu tối như đen, xanh đậm để tạo chiều sâu thị giác.\\n- Ánh sáng đượ...\\nSlide 3: \\\"Ứng dụng thực tế của Midnight theme\\\" — - Được áp dụng phổ biến trong thiết kế website công nghệ, game hoặc blog cá nhân.\\n- Thương hiệu cao ...\\n\\nTrả về JSON array: [{\\\"slide_index\\\": 0, \\\"layout\\\": \\\"cover\\\"}, {\\\"slide_index\\\": 1, \\\"layout\\\": \\\"bullets\\\"}, ...]\"],\"options\":{\"openai_api_key\":{\"lc\":1,\"type\":\"secret\",\"id\":[\"OPENAI_API_KEY\"]},\"model\":\"Qwen3-32B\",\"timeout\":60000,\"max_retries\":2,\"configuration\":{\"baseURL\":\"https://mkp-api.fptcloud.com/v1\",\"fetchOptions\":{}},\"model_kwargs\":{}},\"response\":{\"response\":{\"generations\":[[{\"text\":\"<think>\\nOkay, let's see. I need to assign the most suitable layout to each of the three slides provided. The layouts available are cover, section-header, bullets, two-column, comparison, pros-cons, timeline, roadmap, stat-highlight, kpi-grid, quote, image-full, image-left, image-right, code, terminal, table, chart-placeholder, mindmap, pyramid, funnel, process-steps, checklist, team-grid, pricing, faq, demo, video-embed, closing, thank-you, contact.\\n\\nStarting with Slide 1: \\\"Chủ đề Midnight là gì?\\\" The content here is a definition of the Midnight theme, mentioning it's inspired by the night sky with dark colors. Since this is the first slide and it's introducing the topic, the cover layout makes sense. The cover layout is typically used for the title slide, so that's probably the best fit here.\\n\\nSlide 2: \\\"Nguyên tắc thiết kế cốt lõi\\\" This slide lists core design principles like dark color schemes and lighting effects. The content is in bullet points, so the bullets layout would be appropriate. It's presenting key points, which is what bullets are for.\\n\\nSlide 3: \\\"Ứng dụng thực tế của Midnight theme\\\" Here, the slide talks about real-world applications of the theme in websites, games, blogs, etc. Again, this seems like a list of points, so bullets might be the way to go. But wait, maybe there's a better fit. If there are two columns of information, maybe two-column? But the example given in the problem only has a dash list, so bullets might still be suitable. Alternatively, if there's a comparison between different applications, but the text doesn't indicate that. So probably bullets again.\\n\\nWait, but the user provided three slides. Let me check again. The first slide is the introduction, so cover. The second and third are both lists of points. The bullets layout is designed for such cases where you have a series of points. The two-column layout is for splitting content into two columns, which isn't mentioned here. So the answer should be cover, bullets, bullets.\\n</think>\\n\\n```json\\n[\\n  {\\\"slide_index\\\": 0, \\\"layout\\\": \\\"cover\\\"},\\n  {\\\"slide_index\\\": 1, \\\"layout\\\": \\\"bullets\\\"},\\n  {\\\"slide_index\\\": 2, \\\"layout\\\": \\\"bullets\\\"}\\n]\\n```\",\"generationInfo\":{\"finish_reason\":\"stop\"}}]]},\"tokenUsage\":{\"completionTokens\":494,\"promptTokens\":271,\"totalTokens\":765}}}"}}
