{"__type":"$$EventMessageAiNode","id":"022864fe-d35d-4240-a493-c206266430f8","ts":"2026-06-09T06:39:35.224-04:00","eventName":"n8n.ai.llm.generated","message":"n8n.ai.llm.generated","payload":{"executionId":"68","nodeName":"Model for LLM: Select Layouts","workflowName":"PPTX-Slides: Design Pipeline","nodeType":"@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.lmChatOpenAi","workflowId":"8LVqIvaDIEpH51yk","msg":"{\"messages\":[\"Human: Cho mỗi slide dưới đây, chọn layout phù hợp nhất.\\n\\nDanh sách layouts: cover, section-header, bullets, two-column, comparison, pros-cons, timeline, roadmap, stat-highlight, kpi-grid, quote, image-full, image-left, image-right, code, terminal, table, chart-placeholder, mindmap, pyramid, funnel, process-steps, checklist, team-grid, pricing, faq, demo, video-embed, closing, thank-you, contact\\n\\nSlides:\\nSlide 1: \\\"Định nghĩa Trí tuệ Nhân tạo (AI)\\\" — - Trí tuệ nhân tạo (AI) là lĩnh vực khoa học máy tính mô phỏng tư duy con người để thực hiện các nhi...\\nSlide 2: \\\"Lịch sử Phát triển của AI\\\" — - Khái niệm AI được đề xuất lần đầu năm 1956 tại hội nghị Dartmouth, Mỹ.\\n- Giai đoạn 1970-1980: AI t...\\nSlide 3: \\\"Phân loại AI: Hẹp và Tổng quát\\\" — - AI hẹp (Narrow AI) là hệ thống chuyên sâu vào một lĩnh vực cụ thể như nhận diện giọng nói.\\n- Ví dụ...\\n\\nTrả về JSON array: [{\\\"slide_index\\\": 0, \\\"layout\\\": \\\"cover\\\"}, {\\\"slide_index\\\": 1, \\\"layout\\\": \\\"bullets\\\"}, ...]\"],\"options\":{\"openai_api_key\":{\"lc\":1,\"type\":\"secret\",\"id\":[\"OPENAI_API_KEY\"]},\"model\":\"Qwen3-32B\",\"timeout\":60000,\"max_retries\":2,\"configuration\":{\"baseURL\":\"https://mkp-api.fptcloud.com/v1\",\"fetchOptions\":{}},\"model_kwargs\":{}},\"response\":{\"response\":{\"generations\":[[{\"text\":\"<think>\\nOkay, let's see. I need to assign the most suitable layout for each of the three slides provided. The available layouts are cover, section-header, bullets, two-column, comparison, pros-cons, timeline, roadmap, stat-highlight, kpi-grid, quote, image-full, image-left, image-right, code, terminal, table, chart-placeholder, mindmap, pyramid, funnel, process-steps, checklist, team-grid, pricing, faq, demo, video-embed, closing, thank-you, contact.\\n\\nStarting with Slide 1: \\\"Định nghĩa Trí tuệ Nhân tạo (AI)\\\". The content here is a definition and some explanation. Since it's the first slide, maybe it's the title slide. The cover layout is typically used for the title slide, so that might be appropriate. But wait, the slide has a subtitle or content after the title. The cover layout usually just has a big title and maybe a subtitle, but not bullet points. However, the given example shows that the first slide uses cover. Let me check the user's example again. The user provided an example where Slide 1 is \\\"cover\\\". So maybe that's correct. Alternatively, if the slide has bullet points, maybe \\\"bullets\\\" is better. But since the first slide is usually the cover, I'll go with cover.\\n\\nSlide 2: \\\"Lịch sử Phát triển của AI\\\" — This slide lists historical events with dates and phases. The content is a timeline of AI development. The \\\"timeline\\\" layout is designed for showing chronological information, so that fits well. Alternatively, if there are multiple bullet points, \\\"bullets\\\" could work, but \\\"timeline\\\" is more specific for this kind of data.\\n\\nSlide 3: \\\"Phân loại AI: Hẹp và Tổng quát\\\" — This slide explains the classification into Narrow AI and General AI, with examples. Since it's comparing two types, the \\\"comparison\\\" layout might be suitable. Alternatively, if it's just a list of points, \\\"bullets\\\" could work. But since there are two distinct categories being compared, \\\"comparison\\\" would highlight the differences better.\\n\\nWait, the third slide has two bullet points each explaining a type of AI. Maybe using \\\"two-column\\\" would also be possible, but \\\"comparison\\\" is more about contrasting two things side by side. If the slide is structured as a comparison between Narrow and General AI, then \\\"comparison\\\" is better. If it's just listing two points without direct comparison, maybe \\\"bullets\\\". But the title mentions \\\"Phân loại AI: Hẹp và Tổng quát\\\", which suggests a classification into two types, so \\\"comparison\\\" is appropriate.\\n\\nLet me verify each choice again:\\n\\nSlide 1: Title and definition. Cover layout is standard for the first slide.\\n\\nSlide 2: Historical phases. Timeline is the best fit.\\n\\nSlide 3: Comparison between two AI types. Comparison layout is suitable.\\n\\nYes, that makes sense. So the JSON array would be:\\n\\n[\\n  {\\\"slide_index\\\": 0, \\\"layout\\\": \\\"cover\\\"},\\n  {\\\"slide_index\\\": 1, \\\"layout\\\": \\\"timeline\\\"},\\n  {\\\"slide_index\\\": 2, \\\"layout\\\": \\\"comparison\\\"}\\n]\\n</think>\\n\\n```json\\n[\\n  {\\\"slide_index\\\": 0, \\\"layout\\\": \\\"cover\\\"},\\n  {\\\"slide_index\\\": 1, \\\"layout\\\": \\\"timeline\\\"},\\n  {\\\"slide_index\\\": 2, \\\"layout\\\": \\\"comparison\\\"}\\n]\\n```\",\"generationInfo\":{\"finish_reason\":\"stop\"}}]]},\"tokenUsage\":{\"completionTokens\":712,\"promptTokens\":299,\"totalTokens\":1011}}}"}}
