{"__type":"$$EventMessageAiNode","id":"996257ca-6a81-4e0b-9432-ce43fa34fc33","ts":"2026-06-09T06:50:39.296-04:00","eventName":"n8n.ai.llm.generated","message":"n8n.ai.llm.generated","payload":{"executionId":"80","nodeName":"Model for LLM: Direct Outline","workflowName":"PPTX-Slides: Analysis Pipeline","nodeType":"@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.lmChatOpenAi","workflowId":"P7OnkXnYqu22vHlL","msg":"{\"messages\":[\"Human: Từ prompt sau, hãy tạo outline cho presentation.\\n\\nTrả về JSON:\\n{\\n  \\\"outline\\\": [{\\\"section_id\\\": 0, \\\"title\\\": \\\"...\\\", \\\"slides\\\": 2, \\\"key_points\\\": [\\\"...\\\"]}],\\n  \\\"chunk_mapping\\\": {},\\n  \\\"total_slides\\\": 10,\\n  \\\"topic\\\": \\\"...\\\",\\n  \\\"language\\\": \\\"vi\\\",\\n  \\\"context\\\": \\\"general\\\",\\n  \\\"theme_suggestion\\\": \\\"midnight\\\"\\n}\\n\\nUser prompt: Tao 3 slide gioi thieu ve AI\"],\"options\":{\"openai_api_key\":{\"lc\":1,\"type\":\"secret\",\"id\":[\"OPENAI_API_KEY\"]},\"model\":\"Qwen3-32B\",\"timeout\":60000,\"max_retries\":2,\"configuration\":{\"baseURL\":\"https://mkp-api.fptcloud.com/v1\",\"fetchOptions\":{}},\"model_kwargs\":{}},\"response\":{\"response\":{\"generations\":[[{\"text\":\"<think>\\nOkay, the user wants a presentation outline with 3 slides introducing AI. Let me start by breaking down the main sections they might need. First, an overview of AI is essential to define what it is and its importance. Then, maybe some key applications in different fields like healthcare, finance, and education. Lastly, challenges and ethical considerations would be a good point to cover for a balanced view. \\n\\nWait, the user specified 3 slides but the example JSON shows a total of 10 slides. Hmm, maybe they want the outline to have more sections but only 3 slides for now? Wait, no, the user's prompt says \\\"Tao 3 slide gioi thieu ve AI\\\" which translates to \\\"Create 3 slides introducing AI\\\". So the total slides should be 3. But in the example, the total_slides is 10. Maybe that's a mistake. Let me check the example again.\\n\\nLooking at the example, the user provided a sample response where the outline has 4 sections with 2 slides each, totaling 8 slides, but the total_slides is 10. That seems inconsistent. Maybe the example is just a template, and I should follow the user's instruction of creating 3 slides. So I need to make sure that the total_slides is 3.\\n\\nWait, the user's instruction says \\\"Tạo outline cho presentation\\\" based on their prompt, which is to create 3 slides about AI. So the outline should have sections that add up to 3 slides. Let me structure it into three main sections. Each section can be one slide. For example:\\n\\n1. Introduction to AI (Slide 1)\\n2. Applications of AI (Slide 2)\\n3. Challenges and Ethics (Slide 3)\\n\\nEach slide would have key points. Let me think of the key points for each. For the introduction, definition, history, and types. For applications, maybe healthcare, finance, and education examples. For challenges, data privacy, bias, job displacement, and ethical issues.\\n\\nI need to make sure the JSON structure is correct. The outline array should have three sections, each with section_id, title, slides (which is 1 per section since total is 3), and key_points. The chunk_mapping is empty here, as the user didn't provide specific content chunks. The topic is \\\"Giới thiệu về Trí tuệ Nhân tạo (AI)\\\", language is Vietnamese, context is general, and theme suggestion is midnight.\\n\\nLet me double-check the slide counts. Each section has slides set to 1, so 3 sections total 3 slides. That fits the user's request. The key points should be concise and relevant. Also, using the correct Vietnamese terms. Alright, that should work.\\n</think>\\n\\n```json\\n{\\n  \\\"outline\\\": [\\n    {\\n      \\\"section_id\\\": 0,\\n      \\\"title\\\": \\\"Giới thiệu chung về Trí tuệ Nhân tạo (AI)\\\",\\n      \\\"slides\\\": 1,\\n      \\\"key_points\\\": [\\n        \\\"Định nghĩa AI và mục tiêu cơ bản\\\",\\n        \\\"Lịch sử phát triển của AI từ những năm 1950 đến nay\\\",\\n        \\\"Phân loại AI: Narrow AI, General AI, Superintelligent AI\\\"\\n      ]\\n    },\\n    {\\n      \\\"section_id\\\": 1,\\n      \\\"title\\\": \\\"Ứng dụng thực tế của AI trong đời sống\\\",\\n      \\\"slides\\\": 1,\\n      \\\"key_points\\\": [\\n        \\\"Y tế: Chẩn đoán bệnh, hỗ trợ phẫu thuật\\\",\\n        \\\"Tài chính: Phân tích dữ liệu, phát hiện gian lận\\\",\\n        \\\"Giáo dục: Cá nhân hóa học tập, hỗ trợ giảng dạy\\\"\\n      ]\\n    },\\n    {\\n      \\\"section_id\\\": 2,\\n      \\\"title\\\": \\\"Thách thức và đạo đức trong AI\\\",\\n      \\\"slides\\\": 1,\\n      \\\"key_points\\\": [\\n        \\\"Vấn đề bảo mật và quyền riêng tư dữ liệu\\\",\\n        \\\"Hiệu ứng xã hội: Tự động hóa và mất việc làm\\\",\\n        \\\"Nguyên tắc đạo đức AI: Minh bạch, công bằng và trách nhiệm\\\"\\n      ]\\n    }\\n  ],\\n  \\\"chunk_mapping\\\": {},\\n  \\\"total_slides\\\": 3,\\n  \\\"topic\\\": \\\"Giới thiệu về Trí tuệ Nhân tạo (AI)\\\",\\n  \\\"language\\\": \\\"vi\\\",\\n  \\\"context\\\": \\\"general\\\",\\n  \\\"theme_suggestion\\\": \\\"midnight\\\"\\n}\\n```\",\"generationInfo\":{\"finish_reason\":\"stop\"}}]]},\"tokenUsage\":{\"completionTokens\":923,\"promptTokens\":115,\"totalTokens\":1038}}}"}}
